@RecipeApp.API_HostAddress = http://localhost:5109

### Liveness probe — anonymous, returns 200 without a bearer.
GET {{RecipeApp.API_HostAddress}}/api/health
Accept: application/json

### Register a new user (anonymous, rate-limited: 10/min per IP).
POST {{RecipeApp.API_HostAddress}}/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "demo_user",
  "email": "demo_user@example.com",
  "password": "Password123!"
}

### Log in (anonymous, rate-limited: 10/min per IP). Copy the returned token below.
POST {{RecipeApp.API_HostAddress}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "usernameOrEmail": "demo_user",
  "password": "Password123!"
}

### Current user — requires a bearer token from /auth/login.
GET {{RecipeApp.API_HostAddress}}/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer <paste-token-here>

###
